,"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"<p>En parallèle de ma Licence de Droit, j'ai suivi les enseignements délivrés par le Collège de Droit&nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"silex-id-1736778871288-1","tagName":"DIV","type":"image-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"349px","height":"221px","position":"absolute","top":"17px","left":"30px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":["page-home"],"classList":[],"attr":{},"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":false,"innerHtml":"<img src=\"/ce/github/get/moncv/main/livre 1.jpeg\" />"},{"id":"silex-id-1736778977651-2","tagName":"DIV","type":"text-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"399px","height":"238px","position":"absolute","top":"72.25px","left":"488px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":["page-home"],"classList":[],"attr":{},"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"<p>En parallèle de ma première année de licence de Droit, j'ai suivi les enseignements au Collège de Droit et pour valider le diplôme universitaire nous avons du organiser et mettre en scène le procès du personnage fictif Albus Dumbledore. Avec mon équipe nous étions les avocats de La Défense. Une belle façon d'apprendre de manière ludique !&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"silex-id-1736779204724-3","tagName":"DIV","type":"text-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"421px","height":"142px","position":"absolute","top":"77px","left":"67px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":["page-home"],"classList":[],"attr":{},"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"<p>Dans le cadre de mon master 1 en Information-Communication, j'ai fait un devoir de recherche sur la médiatisation des troubles du comportement alimentaire. Des maladies encore aujourd'hui trop méconnues et victimes de désinformation. &nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"silex-id-1736779227624-5","tagName":"DIV","type":"image-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"380px","height":"244px","position":"absolute","top":"23px","left":"564px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":["page-home"],"classList":[],"attr":{},"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":false,"innerHtml":"<img src=\"/ce/github/get/moncv/main/memoire 1.png\" />"},{"id":"silex-id-1736779206730-4","tagName":"DIV","type":"text-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"399px","height":"238px","position":"absolute","top":"58px","left":"458px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":["page-home"],"classList":[],"attr":{},"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"<p>Passionnée d'écriture depuis l'école primaire, j'ai appris les différentes techniques d'écriture dans l'objectif de publier mon roman dans les prochaines années. Un projet qui demande beaucoup de temps et d'investissement mais dont j'ai hâte la concrétisation !</p>"},{"id":"silex-id-1736779617234-7","tagName":"DIV","ty